    "biography": "<p>@UUID[JournalEntry.WHkwE8CYfaKW5WyO]{Profile: Rosa “Salt” Iturbe}</p><blockquote><p><em>“Nobody kisses rings here. Here, we weld.”</em></p></blockquote><table class=\"sbn-ficha\"><tbody><tr><th>Epithet</th><td>Salt</td></tr><tr><th>Concept</th><td>Baroness of Everett</td></tr><tr><th>Clan</th><td>Brujah</td></tr><tr><th>Sect</th><td>Anarchs</td></tr><tr><th>Sire</th><td>An Anarch from the shipyard, who disappeared in 1999</td></tr><tr><th>Born</th><td>1961</td></tr><tr><th>Embraced</th><td>1991</td></tr><tr><th>Ambition</th><td>For Everett to be a free domain recognized by everyone.</td></tr><tr><th>Coterie</th><td>@UUID[JournalEntry.azX1hjbc0PUp2AA2.JournalEntryPage.SSDCSJFv8Esl6Ki5]{Salt&#39;s}</td></tr></tbody></table><h3>Demeanor</h3><p>Short and compact, short black hair, welding burns on her forearms; blue work coveralls with her name embroidered on them and steel-toed boots.</p>",
